        <span itemprop="subject">the slurry</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was coated using a die coater onto one side of a 20  ⁇ m-thick aluminum foil sheet as the positive electrode collector, and dried at 130° C. for 3 minutes, after which it was compression molded using a roll press, to fabricate a positive electrode.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0219">
