      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">liquid paraffin</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was further injected from the middle level of extrusion (the middle feed port of the twin-screw extruder) so that the liquid paraffin quantity ratio was 70 weight % of the resin composition extruded from the twin-screw extruder, and the temperature of the resin composition was 220° C.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0234">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
